                    <occupation>newspaper editor</occupation>
                    <occupation>barrister</occupation>
                    <note type="editorial"><p/>Godwin meets him in relation to <persName key="HAZ01">William Hazlitt</persName>, and he was godfather to one
    of Hazlitt's children. <persName key="SHE02">Mary Shelley</persName> refers to him as Colson in her journal and Godwin's entries for Colson seem to fit and 
    have accordingly been coded as Coulson.
    
  </note>
